TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_PostApoc_UnauthorizedSalvage.option0.outcome0.Detail=<skip/>
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_PostApoc_UnauthorizedSalvage.option0.outcome1=Копатели нашли старые книги.
